$MDESC::Type = "CTF_S_hift";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Earth Zen Master Dynasty" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The Zen Master has ordered the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> to battle each other with their massive Dynasty bases.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base to capture it for a point. The first team to reach 15 points shall be the victor!";